# brig learning log (example — `.local/` is gitignored, do not commit)

> Append-only. Entries record what failed, what worked, and the rule.
> Never auto-promoted to AGENTS.md — promotion is a deliberate human edit.

- failed `pytest` with no venv -> worked `uv run pytest` => rule: always run tests via `uv run`
- failed whole-file read for symbol lookup -> worked index `search_symbols` + byte span => rule: retrieve exact spans, not files
- failed <describe an example failure> -> worked <what fixed it> => rule: <short rule>

<!-- brig:learn:end -->
